{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'git show upstream/main:.github/workflows/metrics.yml && git log -8 --oneline --all -- ci/metrics-allow.edn && ls -la AGENTS.md .agents'","aggregated_output":"name: metrics\n\n# Publishes the findings as a report, and fails the build (ci/metrics-gate.clj) on\n# a critical finding under a path ci/metrics-allow.edn holds critical-free, or on\n# unused code beyond that file's allowlist.\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  pull_request:\n\nconcurrency:\n  group: metrics-${{ github.event.pull_request.number && format('pr-{0}', github.event.pull_request.number) || github.ref }}\n  cancel-in-progress: ${{ github.ref != 'refs/heads/main' }}\n\nenv:\n  # pinned: a new release would change what CI runs on. jolt-metrics declares\n  # :jolt/min-version, so a METRICS_SHA bump may need a JOLT_VERSION bump too.\n  JOLT_VERSION: v0.8.27\n  METRICS_SHA: 3e13e1f1b86e7ba2db3f28125279864ef7ff0818\n\njobs:\n  report:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 15\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          # hotspots read churn from the git history\n          fetch-depth: 0\n      - name: Install jolt\n        run: |\n          sudo apt-get update\n          sudo apt-get install -y liblz4-1 zlib1g libtinfo6\n          curl -sL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jolt-lang/jolt/main/install | bash -s -- --version \"$JOLT_VERSION\"\n          echo \"$HOME/.local/bin\" >> \"$GITHUB_PATH\"\n      - name: Run jolt-metrics\n        run: |\n          jolt -Sdeps \"{:deps {io.github.jlt-commons/jolt-metrics {:git/url \\\"https://github.com/jlt-commons/jolt-metrics\\\" :git/sha \\\"$METRICS_SHA\\\"}}}\" \\\n            -m metrics.cli . metrics-report.md --top 50\n          # the summary stops before the long per-file tables\n          awk '/^## Cleanup candidates/{exit} {print}' metrics-report.md >> \"$GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY\"\n      - name: Check for critical findings and unused code\n        run: |\n          jolt -Sdeps \"{:deps {io.github.jlt-commons/jolt-metrics {:git/url \\\"https://github.com/jlt-commons/jolt-metrics\\\" :git/sha \\\"$METRICS_SHA\\\"}}}\" \\\n            -m metrics.cli . metrics-report.edn --format edn\n          jolt ci/metrics-gate.clj metrics-report.edn ci/metrics-allow.edn\n      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v6\n        if: always()\n        with:\n          name: metrics-report\n          path: metrics-report.md\ne97d6738 Bundle jsonista.core in compatibility/, so muuntaja loads (#1683)\n8cbbfa3d Bundle bencode.core for babashka scripts\n20762003 CI: fail on critical jolt-metrics findings in jolt-core; latest jolt-metrics\n539a4728 metrics allowlist: drop the jolt.passes re-export entry\ncc68a147 Allowlist cheshire's uncalled public API in the metrics gate\ne00abd38 Pin jolt-metrics v0.1.2, name jolt's API, and gate unused public functions\nd29e00fa Fail CI on unused code beyond an allowlist\nls: .agents: No such file or directory\nls: AGENTS.md: No such file or directory\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
