e/tmp/jolt-allowfix.uxnaaybS/jolt-metrics-v0.8.2-aarch64-macos/README.md:641:  adapter's `:lint`. `metrics.scanner` finds ignore markers, and\n/private/tmp/jolt-allowfix.uxnaaybS/jolt-metrics-v0.8.2-aarch64-macos/README.md:642:  `metrics.ignore` drops what they cover from the lint findings, the queue and\n/private/tmp/jolt-allowfix.uxnaaybS/jolt-metrics-v0.8.2-aarch64-macos/README.md:785:Every run also builds the binary on macOS, Linux and Windows and runs\n/private/tmp/jolt-allowfix.uxnaaybS/jolt-metrics-v0.8.2-aarch64-macos/README.md:807:The lint rules (`metrics.lint`), the ignore markers and the SARIF output\n/private/tmp/jolt-allowfix.uxnaaybS/jolt-metrics-v0.8.2-aarch64-macos/README.md:808:(`metrics.sarif`) are adapted from [clj-kondo](https://github.com/clj-kondo/clj-kondo),\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
